---
import Icons from "./Icons.astro";
const cmd = "pip install ceng-context";
---
<section id="install" class="relative border-t border-white/6 py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Install once</p><h2 class="mt-5 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-.035em] text-white sm:text-5xl">A clean start in one command.</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">The package on PyPI is called <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">ceng-context</span>. The import stays short: <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">ceng</span>.</p><div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.03]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono text-sm text-slate-200"><span class="text-brand-300">$</span> {cmd}</code><button data-copy={cmd} aria-label="Copy install command" class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/10 text-slate-400 hover:border-brand-400/40 hover:text-white"><Icons name="copy" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /><span class="copy-feedback" aria-hidden="true">Copied</span></button></div></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[.78rem] text-slate-500"><span>Python 3.10–3.13</span><span>Apache-2.0</span><span>Optional OpenAI, vLLM, tiktoken extras</span></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0d18]/90 shadow-[0_30px_80px_-45px_rgba(77,125,255,.4)]" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/8 px-5 py-4"><span class="font-mono text-[.7rem] text-slate-500">quickstart.py</span><span class="text-[.7rem] text-emerald-300">works with your stack</span></div><div class="code-scroll overflow-x-auto p-6"><pre class="font-mono text-[.82rem] leading-7 text-slate-400"><code><span class="k-token-4">from</span> ceng <span class="k-token-4">import</span> ppa_compress

context = ppa_compress(
    messages,
    budget_tokens=<span class="k-num">2400</span>,
    llm=<span class="k-token-3">"gpt-4o-mini"</span>,
)

<span class="k-token-4">print</span>(context)</code></pre></div></div></div></div></section>
